# title: Arithmetic Asian call
# category: Asians, lookbacks and ladders
# underlyings: 1
# source: Kemna & Vorst, A Pricing Method for Options Based on Average Asset Values, Journal of Banking & Finance, 1990
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on the average of twelve monthly closes instead of the final price: cheaper than a vanilla, and hard to manipulate at expiry.
#
# Strike: 100% of the strike-date level. Average of 12 monthly fixings,
# the last one on the maturity date.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()
    acc = 0
    n = 0

schedule(2027-02-04, 2027-12-04, 1M, US, F)
    acc = acc + spot()
    n = n + 1

2028-01-04
    acc = acc + spot()
    n = n + 1
    pays max(acc / n - s0, 0)
